Added `sles-15.7-*` (SUSE Linux Enterprise Server 15 SP7), `sles-16.0-*` (SUSE Linux Enterprise Server 16.0) and `sles-16.1-*` (SUSE Linux Enterprise Server 16.1) configs for x86_64, aarch64, ppc64le and s390x. They need a SUSE subscription, and a `distribution-gpg-keys` version with the SHA-256 re-signed SUSE keys. The bootstrap chroot gets `dnf` (SLES 15) or `dnf5` (SLES 16) from SUSE Package Hub; so the buildroot **only** uses the SLES repositories.
